                                                "text": "1983. Rosen, Stanley. Plato’s Sophist: The Drama of Original & Image. South Bend, Indiana, USA: St. Augustine’s Press. p. 62.\nHe is struck by Antinous, who is in turn reprimanded by one of the “proud young men” courting Penelope:"
